sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant Wallet as MetaMask
    participant Token as ERC20 Token
    participant Vault as YieldVaultMultiAsset
    participant Aave as Aave V3 Pool
    participant Oracle as AbstractFeedProxy
    
    Note over User,Oracle: Deposit Flow
    
    User->>Frontend: Select asset and amount
    Frontend->>Oracle: Fetch current price
    Oracle-->>Frontend: Return USD price
    Frontend->>Frontend: Display value estimate
    
    User->>Frontend: Click Deposit
    Frontend->>Wallet: Request approval signature
    Wallet-->>User: Confirm approval
    User->>Wallet: Approve
    Wallet->>Token: approve(vault, amount)
    Token-->>Wallet: Approval confirmed
    
    Frontend->>Wallet: Request deposit signature
    Wallet-->>User: Confirm deposit
    User->>Wallet: Approve
    Wallet->>Vault: depositByToken(token, amount)
    
    Vault->>Token: transferFrom(user, vault, amount)
    Vault->>Token: approve(aavePool, amount)
    Vault->>Aave: supply(token, amount, vault, 0)
    Aave-->>Vault: Mint aToken to vault
    
    Vault->>Vault: Update user shares
    Vault-->>Frontend: Emit Deposit event
    Frontend-->>User: Display success
